                <p class="fst-italic">
                  This service is available to the citizen who are residing
                  in the area of Commissionerate of police Cuttack and Bhubaneswar and to the citizens residing
                  other places of the state where (30 Police Act) has been promulgated by the district
                  authority.
                </p>
